<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">chrysalis-stride</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

An enchantment applied to leg coverings. Metamorphic energy kindles
within the fabric, granting the swift grace of Chrysalis emergence.

