  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 15)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Target:</ansi>      leg armor
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> chrysalis setting (x1), mutation catalyst (x1),
                 binding paste (x2)

